abstract: >-
  Interactive, open-source explainer and TypeScript reference library
  (poincare-ball) for "LLM Orchestration with Geometry-Aware Memory"
  (IEEE ICBDML 2026): nine scroll-driven chapters on hyperbolic memory,
  orchestration and synthesis, with every figure computed in the browser.
